projects. Any copied source code or documentation must retain the original
license and copyright notice. The upstream projects are wire-cable and
n8n-based demos respectively; QuoteSentry replaces the domain model, catalog,
matching, pricing, approval, audit, and export logic for fastener RFQ review.

